-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Two new Uniforms, Madelyne Pryor &lt;Winter Queen&gt;, </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">and Scarlet Spider &lt;Gift Deliverer&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 12/22 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.